==English==
{{wikipedia}}
{{slim-wikipedia|Lebanon (disambiguation)}}

===Etymology===
The country's name comes from the name of the mountain range, which in turn comes from {{bor|en|hbo|לְבָנוֹן|tr=ləḇānôn}}, from {{der|en|sem-wes-pro|*laban-|t=white}} (compare {{cog|he|לָבָן|tr=lāḇān|t=white}}, {{cog|ar|لَبَن|t=milk}}).

